{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、\nプリンシパルの初レッスンがありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年とは\nまた違った感じになりそう！\n良かった〜ヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり大変そうだなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあね、\n簡単なものじゃ意味無いんだけどね(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしいステージにはつきものですからね、はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張らなきゃな｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださるかたは\n楽しみにしててください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/04/09/0880585/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/04/09/0880585/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな問題集Vol.2"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/04/09/0880585/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４.中田家の冷蔵庫は片開き？両開き？観音開き？\n※片開き...決まった方向にのみ開けるやつ\n両開き...右からでも左からでも開けるやつ\n観音開き...真ん中からあけるやつ\nとして考えてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５.乃木坂のブログができて中田が一番最初にブログを更新したのは何年何月何日？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"６.1回だけメンバーのブログにコメントしたことありますが誰のでしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回、全問正解者0だったし\n今回こそは誰かに当てていただきたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また次の次の記事で答え書きまーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/04/09/0880585/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","t